{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y 在 S07、S09、S13 的感受提示偶有近义堆叠，个别表达如“对生命的眷恋”显得拔高；这些地方 X 的短词更利落、克制。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y 用【】直接标出每段叙事的关键抓手，短句又把人物的念头、顾虑和行动拆开，配合感受按乐句出现，扫读时更容易抓住重点，也更容易跟上音乐。它从最初想靠近却怕暴露，到被看见后的不安、重新接纳自己的喜欢，最后不再强求永远，人物心理的变化有连续的因果关系。感受方面，Y 对呼吸、身体、声部、水波和音乐起伏的对应更细，尤其是情绪转折处，不只是给出悲伤、快乐之类的结论，而是呈现情绪如何发生变化。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a64c268d-ea24-4ade-922e-0c0a4cde5747", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193756483285Z", "elapsed_seconds": 151.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:40:27.792966+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5020e79c5cecf2cb3a34d4087ed73193f25035fc7bfabb426f33216395909f22", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000